{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々、わからなくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何が正解か、不正解か。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとり、孤独の中で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得体の知れない何かに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"押し潰されそうになる時もある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰かに背中を押してもらえたなら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、そっと支えてくれるだけでもいい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんなに楽なことだろう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、闘うしかない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分自身と。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はみんなの笑顔がみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから辛いときこそ笑顔でいよう(* ^_^ *)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのかわり、私が嬉し涙で溢れた時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に泣いてくれるかな...？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日放送された、乃木坂って、どこ？での"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8th選抜発表を見てくださった方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難う御座います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、私を応援してくださるファンのみなさん、本当に有難う、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にごめんなさい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生をかけて本気でやってきたからこそ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から悔しいって、思ったし、"},{"type":"break"},{"ty